      "created_at": "2025-07-27T05:26:26.116Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, you can do it by using hook in custom app:<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#javascript--css-assets\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/python-api/hooks#javascript--css-assets</a></p>\n<p>Additionally, you can add web template  in your custom app.<br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/tutorial/portal-pages#customize-web-view-template\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/tutorial/portal-pages#customize-web-view-template</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/guides/portal-development/generators\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/guides/portal-development/generators</a></p>",
